    {
      "id": "wvVpQHAPF3Sh78ksBYFGT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4377.338382491673,
      "y": 93887.68699095084,
      "width": 1188,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 966208559,
      "version": 292,
      "versionNonce": 786156673,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776071367563,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "像其他容器放的本质目的，\n是为了给sse队列服务的，给sse队列服务的目的是前端追踪查询任务的状态",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "像其他容器放的本质目的，\n是为了给sse队列服务的，给sse队列服务的目的是前端追踪查询任务的状态",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ta7DDfgzRu61NTdmNMrCf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4941.630474961164,
      "y": 93257.01372640741,
      "width": 972,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1249070543,
      "version": 127,
      "versionNonce": 1338146383,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776071356926,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "生成者的其它节点没处理，以及消费者都没处理（明天实现）",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "生成者的其它节点没处理，以及消费者都没处理（明天实现）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Q2FSzc9kRuXgUNQUhf9w5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4672.919954737597,
      "y": 94823.80275971098,
      "width": 1476,
      "height": 540,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 723861953,
      "version": 922,
      "versionNonce": 925024641,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776071831887,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "对于SSE来说：两大核心要素，在使用过程中考虑。\n第一大要素：事件类型，支持自定义，根据业务定义不同类型。\n第二大要素：事件对应的数据。数据结构内容支持自定义，根据业务定义不同的数据结构内容\n\n这两大要素：最终组合成SSE数据包(pack)。格式必须如下：\n“event:不能变\\ndata:不能变 \\n\\n\"\nevent:\"自定义的事假类型\"\ndata:自定义的数据（格式、内容自己指定）\n\nxxx\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "对于SSE来说：两大核心要素，在使用过程中考虑。\n第一大要素：事件类型，支持自定义，根据业务定义不同类型。\n第二大要素：事件对应的数据。数据结构内容支持自定义，根据业务定义不同的数据结构内容\n\n这两大要素：最终组合成SSE数据包(pack)。格式必须如下：\n“event:不能变\\ndata:不能变 \\n\\n\"\nevent:\"自定义的事假类型\"\ndata:自定义的数据（格式、内容自己指定）\n\nxxx\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
